  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a pan or grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Slice the broccoli into florets and cook until tender.",
    "3. In a separate pan, toast the wrap for a few seconds on each side.",
    "4. Spread Russian dressing on the wrap.",
    "5. Add cooked broccoli, sliced green onions, grated carrots, and a sprinkle of sesame seeds on top of the dressing.",
    "6. Drizzle with soy sauce if desired.",
    "7. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "8. Fold the wrap to enclose the filling.",
    "9. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
